# The Vercel project builds the server/ folder; nothing else in the repo is
# part of that build. Without this the CLI uploads the whole working tree -
# the Android build output and the graphify snapshots included - and it runs
# into the 15000-file limit.
Android/app/build
Android/build
Android/.gradle
Packages/*/.build
Packages/*/.build-android
Packages/MeditateAndNoteCore/.generated
graphify-out
Android/graphify-out
*.xcodeproj
docs
tombstones
